Print preserves the source order of tags and comments on transaction and posting lines.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight print

========== API ==========

print()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
tag Reviewed
tag Imported
tag Category
tag Receipt
; Root note

2024-01-01 Tagged ; :Reviewed:Imported: header note
  ; first comment
  ; Category: books
  ; second comment
  Assets:Cash  10 SEK ; [2024-01-02] :Receipt: card
  ; posting comment one
  ; :Imported: follow-up note
  ; posting comment two
  Equity:Opening  -10 SEK

